## Local per-device runtime data (device id / device list / settings)
## Real installs store this under %ProgramData%\HaelpMi (Teil 2, FR-34) — nothing here
## should end up in the repo, this is just belt-and-suspenders for local test runs.
**/AppDataLocal/
**/*.devicelist.json
**/*.identity.json
